  "title": " AI is the new starting point for work, but finishing it still requires a manual \"last mile\" ",
  "link": "  https://blog.dropbox.com/topics/company/ai-last-mile-work-study ",
  "pub_date": " Wed, 23 Sep 2026 06:00:00 -0700 ",
  "author": "Dropbox Team",
  "content_snippet": "A Dropbox-sponsored study of more than 500 US professionals who use AI reveals just how wide the gap is between where work starts and what it takes to finish it.",
  "content_full": "\n\n\n<div class=\"aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 \">\n    \n    <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank text parbase aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__wrapper\" data-highlight=\"coconut\">\r\n    <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__container  \">\r\n        <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__sidebar\">\n\n\n\n\n</div>\r\n        <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__content\">\r\n            <div class=\"a01-text\">\r\n\r\n<p><i><b>AI is supposed to reduce busywork, but people are still doing much of the manual work required after AI creates an output. A Dropbox-sponsored study found that while 54% of professionals now start knowledge work with AI, 74% manually move AI output between apps at least three times on an average AI workday, and only 11% say AI produces finished work without further barriers. </b></i></p>\n<p>A Dropbox-sponsored study of more than 500 US professionals who use AI reveals just how wide the gap is between where work starts and what it takes to finish it.</p>\n<p>AI can generate an answer in seconds, but getting that output across the “last mile” into finished work still requires the right context, verification, people, permissions, and workflows. Today, that often means moving content between apps, sharing it with team members, and getting it ready for review. </p>\n<h3>What we found</h3>\n<ul><li><p><b>AI is becoming where work starts, but rarely where it finishes.</b> More than half of respondents (54%) say an AI assistant is now their primary starting point for new knowledge work, ahead of documents, email, search engines, and project management tools. Yet only 11% say AI already generates finished work without further barriers. </p>\n</li><li><p><b>The last mile remains manual.</b> Nearly three-quarters (74%) manually move AI-generated work between applications at least three times on an average AI workday. For 30%, that happens six or more times, while 65% use three or more applications to complete a typical AI-assisted task.</p>\n</li><li><p><b>AI output is becoming organizational knowledge.</b> Forty-three percent say most of their weekly AI-assisted work becomes permanent team documentation or part of a shared knowledge base.</p>\n</li></ul>\n\r\n</div>\r\n            \n\n\n\n\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\n<div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__wrapper\">\r\n    <div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__container img-left\">\r\n        <div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__image\">\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                \r\n    \r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        <!--<sly data-sly-use.assetPath1x=\"com.dropbox.aem.common.models.utils.RewriterHelperModel\"/>-->\r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        <!--<sly data-sly-test.scaledImagePath=\"\"/>-->\r\n\r\n\t\t <!--optimized image webp-->\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n        <!--<img data-sly-test.highRes=\"false\"\r\n                srcset=\", /cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png 2x\"\r\n                src=\"/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png\"\r\n                aria-hidden=\"\"\r\n                alt=\"\"\r\n                class=\"\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.width=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.height=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.data-id=\"\"\r\n                data-aem-asset-id=\"e22736ab-0f0b-41ee-906a-5cf7c6ccffec:Slide_1.png\"\r\n                data-trackable=\"true\" />\r\n        <img data-sly-test=\"true\"\r\n                src=\"/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png\"\r\n                aria-hidden=\"false\"\r\n                alt=\"\"\r\n                class=\"\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.width=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.height=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.data-id=\"\"\r\n                data-aem-asset-id=\"e22736ab-0f0b-41ee-906a-5cf7c6ccffec:Slide_1.png\"\r\n                data-trackable=\"true\" />-->\r\n\r\n\t    \r\n      <picture>\r\n        <source media=\"(min-width: 800px)\" srcset=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_1.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png\"/>\r\n        <source media=\"(min-width: 480px)\" srcset=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_1.tablet.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_1.tablet.webp\"/>\r\n        <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_1.mobile.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_1.mobile.webp\"/>\r\n         \r\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_1.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_1.png\" onerror=\"window.failedAttempts=0;this.setAttribute('src',this.getAttribute('fallbackimage'));window.failedAttempts++;if(window.failedAttempts == 1)this.onerror=null\" aria-hidden=\"false\" alt=\"\" data-aem-asset-id=\"e22736ab-0f0b-41ee-906a-5cf7c6ccffec:Slide_1.png\" data-trackable=\"true\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1080\"/>\r\n      </picture>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n            \r\n            \r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__text\">\r\n            <div class=\"a01-text\">\r\n\r\n<h3>AI changed where work starts</h3>\n<p>AI is rapidly lowering the barrier to creating a first output. But starting work in AI doesn’t mean finishing it there.</p>\n<p>Accuracy is the biggest obstacle to turning AI-generated output into finished business work, cited by 40% of respondents, followed by security requirements or company protocols at 26%. As AI-generated work becomes part of everyday business workflows, that makes trusted context, permissions, and governance an important part of getting work across the finish line. </p>\n<p>That helps explain why 84% of professionals surveyed agree that AI is helping employees create work faster than their organization’s processes and workflows can keep up.</p>\n<p> </p>\n\r\n</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\n<div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank text parbase aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__wrapper\" data-highlight=\"coconut\">\r\n    <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__container  \">\r\n        <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__sidebar\">\n\n\n\n\n</div>\r\n        <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__content\">\r\n            <div class=\"a01-text\">\r\n\r\n<h3>The new \"last mile\" of work</h3>\n<p>That work after generation is AI’s new “last mile.” Output still has to move through the context, verification, people, decisions, permissions, and workflows required to make it trusted and usable. As AI tools expand beyond generation, the challenge is keeping that work connected across the tools, systems, and people teams rely on. That’s where Dropbox comes in, connecting people and content so work can keep moving. </p>\n<p>Consider a customer proposal. AI might generate the first draft, but someone still needs to check it against customer information, gather feedback, incorporate revisions, get approval, and save the finished version somewhere the team can find and reuse.</p>\n\r\n</div>\r\n            \n\n\n\n\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\n<div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__wrapper\">\r\n    <div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__container img-left\">\r\n        <div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__image\">\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                \r\n    \r\n\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        <!--<sly data-sly-use.assetPath1x=\"com.dropbox.aem.common.models.utils.RewriterHelperModel\"/>-->\r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        <!--<sly data-sly-test.scaledImagePath=\"\"/>-->\r\n\r\n\t\t <!--optimized image webp-->\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n        <!--<img data-sly-test.highRes=\"false\"\r\n                srcset=\", /cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png 2x\"\r\n                src=\"/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png\"\r\n                aria-hidden=\"\"\r\n                alt=\"\"\r\n                class=\"\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.width=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.height=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.data-id=\"\"\r\n                data-aem-asset-id=\"65103009-3d1e-4c69-827c-b80251ca27ff:Slide_3.png\"\r\n                data-trackable=\"true\" />\r\n        <img data-sly-test=\"true\"\r\n                src=\"/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png\"\r\n                aria-hidden=\"false\"\r\n                alt=\"\"\r\n                class=\"\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.width=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.height=\"1080\"\r\n                data-sly-attribute.data-id=\"\"\r\n                data-aem-asset-id=\"65103009-3d1e-4c69-827c-b80251ca27ff:Slide_3.png\"\r\n                data-trackable=\"true\" />-->\r\n\r\n\t    \r\n      <picture>\r\n        <source media=\"(min-width: 800px)\" srcset=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_3.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png\"/>\r\n        <source media=\"(min-width: 480px)\" srcset=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_3.tablet.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_3.tablet.webp\"/>\r\n        <source media=\"(min-width: 0px)\" srcset=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_3.mobile.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_3.mobile.webp\"/>\r\n         \r\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png/_jcr_content/renditions/Slide_3.webp\" fallbackimage=\"https://aem.dropbox.com/cms/content/dam/dropbox/blog/files/2026/september/ai-friction-survey/social/Slide_3.png\" onerror=\"window.failedAttempts=0;this.setAttribute('src',this.getAttribute('fallbackimage'));window.failedAttempts++;if(window.failedAttempts == 1)this.onerror=null\" aria-hidden=\"false\" alt=\"\" data-aem-asset-id=\"65103009-3d1e-4c69-827c-b80251ca27ff:Slide_3.png\" data-trackable=\"true\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1080\"/>\r\n      </picture>\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n            \r\n            \r\n            \r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"b05-text-image-diptych-plank__text\">\r\n            <div class=\"a01-text\">\r\n\r\n<h3>The next phase of AI is turning output into durable work</h3>\n<p>At Dropbox, we believe solving AI’s last-mile challenge means looking beyond generation. As work moves across AI tools, people, and systems, the content and context behind it need to stay connected, and the resulting work needs to remain trusted, accessible, and ready for teams to continue building on it. </p>\n<p>We’re already seeing customers bring Dropbox into their AI workflows, with usage across partner AI tools growing 13x over the last four months. Through integrations with tools like <a href=\"https://blog.dropbox.com/topics/company/dropbox-into-chatgpt-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ChatGPT</a>, <a href=\"https://blog.dropbox.com/topics/news/work-seamlessly-with-dropbox-in-claude\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Claude</a>, <a href=\"https://blog.dropbox.com/topics/company/bring-dropbox-context-into-google-gemini-experiences\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gemini</a>, <a href=\"https://x.com/runwayml/status/2087552165703504056\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Runway</a>, <a href=\"https://superhuman.com/store/connectors/dropbox-56337\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Superhuman</a>, and <a href=\"https://x.com/mondaydotcom/status/2091885745677967485\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Monday.com</a>, we’re making it easier to start work in AI tools while keeping it durable.</p>\n\r\n</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\n<div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank text parbase aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__wrapper\" data-highlight=\"coconut\">\r\n    <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__container  \">\r\n        <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__sidebar\">\n\n\n\n\n</div>\r\n        <div class=\"b02-rich-text-plank__content\">\r\n            <div class=\"a01-text\">\r\n\r\n<p>We’re building Dropbox to play a broader role in that last mile by helping content and context stay connected across AI experiences, while giving teams a consistent place to continue, share, and build on their work.  </p>\n<p>AI has already changed the first mile of work. The next opportunity is making the last mile as seamless as the first.</p>\n<p style=\"\ttext-align: center;\n\">~ ~ ~</p>\n<p><b>About the research</b></p>\n<p>Dropbox sponsored a survey of 504 AI-using US B2B professionals from July 28 to July 30, 2026. Respondents represented functions including IT, engineering, sales, marketing, finance, operations, HR, and customer support.</p>\n\r\n</div>\r\n            \n\n\n\n\n\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\n\n    \n</div>\n",
